function updateProfileLabels(user){const company=user?.role==='admin'?'AI Call Center':(user?.name||'Müşteri');const initials=String(company).split(/\s+/).map(x=>x[0]).join('').slice(0,2).toUpperCase();document.querySelector('#top-company-name')?.replaceChildren(document.createTextNode(company));document.querySelector('#sidebar-company-name')?.replaceChildren(document.createTextNode(company));document.querySelector('.profile-avatar')?.replaceChildren(document.createTextNode(initials));document.querySelector('.user-avatar')?.replaceChildren(document.createTextNode(initials));const role=document.querySelector('#sidebar-user-role');if(role)role.textContent=user?.role==='admin'?'Yönetici':'Müşteri hesabı';}
const _applyUser=applyUser;applyUser=function(user){_applyUser(user);updateProfileLabels(user);if(user?.role==='customer')loadAiSettings();else{aiSettingsTenant=null;if(location.hash==='#opening-message')setView('dashboard');}};
document.querySelector('.profile-chip')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const menu=document.querySelector('.profile-menu');if(!menu)return;const open=menu.hidden;menu.hidden=!open;document.querySelector('.profile-chip').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));});document.querySelector('[data-profile-settings]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelector('.profile-menu').hidden=true;setView('settings');window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});});document.querySelector('[data-profile-logout]')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{await fetch('/api/logout',{method:'POST',credentials:'same-origin'});location.reload();});document.querySelector('.notification-button')?.addEventListener('click',()=>showToast('Yeni bildirim bulunmuyor.'));
